OMIPIPROOF = CHECKED [ BREAKS UNCHECKED ] .

CHECKED = HEAD COQ COQA COQB COQC COQD COQE COQF COQG COQH COQI LISTNOTATIONS SCOPE NIBBLE POLYXOR DPLUS DPLUSA DPLUSB DPLUSC DMINUS DMINUSA DMINUSB DMINUSC DPLUSXORZERO DMINUSXORZERO DPLUSSUME DMINUSSUME DIAGONALCLOSURE DPLUSCLOSURE DMINUSCLOSURE DPLUSCLOSUREVALID DMINUSCLOSUREVALID DIAGSUMC ISDPLUS ISDMINUS COMPLEMENTSUM COMPLEMENTSUMC WHEELSUM FULLWHEELSUM MASK ROTL ROTR DELTA MASKBOUND DELTAWIDTHPRESERVING DELTADETERMINISTIC TETRAINCIDENCE TETRAUNIT TETRAINCIDENCEEQUALITIES TETRACENTROIDVERTEXSQDIST PROJECTEDLENGTHSQUARED SQRTISPROJECTIONBOUNDARY FANOLINE FANOPOINTS FANOLINES FANOLINECOUNT FANOPOINTCOUNT FANOLINEPOINTS NMEM FANOLINECONTAINS FANOPOINTLINECOUNT FANOPAIRLINECOUNT FANOEACHLINEHASTHREEPOINTS FANOEACHPOINTHASTHREELINES FANOEACHPAIRHASUNIQUELINE FANOLINEWIDTHS FANOPOINTDEGREES FANOPAIRUNIQUELINES VALIDFANOPLANE TINCIDENCE TFANOINCIDENCE VALIDTINCIDENCE FANOPLANEVALID TINDUCESFANOPLANE SCHLAFLISYMBOL SCHLAFLI SCHLAFLIA SCHLAFLIDUAL DUAL RECTIFIEDCOMMONCORE RECTIFIEDCOMMONCOREA VALIDRECTIFIEDCOMMONCORE RECTIFIEDCOMMONCOREVALID BQFHIGHSHELL BQFCHIRALBRIDGE BQFLOCALSEED BQF BQFDECOMPOSE BQFCHIRALBRIDGEISXY BQFLAYERSUM PROJECTIONBOUNDARY OMIPROJECTIONBOUNDARY PROJECTIONBOUNDARYSEPARATION SCOPEA OMISQRT OMISQRTSQUARED CLASSICALPHI SQRTSQFORPHI PHISTEP PHIFIXEDPOINTEQUATION CLASSICALPHISATISFIESQUADRATIC CLASSICALPHIPOSITIVE CLASSICALPHIFIXEDBYSTEP OMIPHIWITNESS OMIPHI OMIPHIFROMINCIDENCE OMIPHISATISFIESQUADRATIC OMIPHIPOSITIVE OMIPHIFIXEDBYSTEP OMIPHIEQUALSCLASSICALPHI OMISQRTSQUAREDA OMISQRTFROMPHI PHIITER PHIITERA PHIITERSTEP PHIITERPOSITIVE OMIPHIRECURRENCEFIXEDPOINT OMIPHIFROMRECURRENCE OMIPHIFROMRECURRENCEEQUALSOMIPHI OMIPHIFROMRECURRENCEEQUALSCLASSICALPHI FIB FIBSUCCPOSITIVE FIBRATIO PHIITERFIBRATIO OMIPHIGT PHIITERGE PHIERRORSTEP PHIITERERRORBOUND PHIITERCONVERGES FIBRATIOCONVERGESPHI CHIRALPHASE PHASETOSIGN DIAGONALPHASESCHEDULE POLYBIUSPHASEAT DIAGONALRACEPHASE DIAGONALPHASESCHEDULEEVEN POLYBIUSDIAGONALRACEFORCESPHASESCHEDULE DIAGONALACCUMULATOR DIAGONALCLOSUREREADY DIAGONALACCUMULATORSTEP DIAGONALACCUMULATORAT DIAGONALACCUMULATORPHASE NATINDUCTIONBYTWO DIAGONALACCUMULATORFORCESPHASESCHEDULE DIAGONALACCUMULATORPHASEMATCHESRACE FIVEFACTORIALRESOLUTION LOCALRESOLUTION LOCALISTWOFACTORIAL GLOBALRESOLUTION GLOBALRESOLUTIONA SIXFACTORIALIS GLOBALISTIMES FANOSELECTOR LOCALSELECTOR PROJECTIONDENOMINATORINDEX BQFBRIDGE BRIDGEPHASE BRIDGEDENOMINATOR BQFBRIDGEAT FANOSELECTORBOUND LOCALSELECTORBOUND BQFBRIDGEPHASEMATCHESACCUMULATOR BQFBRIDGEPHASECOMPUTEDFROMORBIT BQFBRIDGEDENOMINATORCOMPUTEDFROMORBIT BQFBRIDGECROSSISXY DPLUSPHASESIGN DMINUSPHASESIGN OMIPI OMIPIPHASEEVEN OMIPISIGN OMIPIDEN BQFBRIDGEDENOMINATORMATCHESPROJECTION BQFBRIDGECARRIESPROJECTIONSCHEDULE OMIPITERMFROMINCIDENCE POLYBIUSPHASESIGNMATCHESOMIPISIGN OMIPITERMFROMPOLYBIUS OMIPITERMFROMPOLYBIUSMATCHESINCIDENCE OMIPITERMFROMDIAGONALRACE OMIPITERMFROMDIAGONALRACEMATCHESPOLYBIUS OMIPITERMFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOR OMIPITERMFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATORMATCHESRACE OMIPISIGNMATCHESALTERNATION OMIPITERMMATCHESTGALT OMIPIPARTIAL OMIPIPARTIALFROMINCIDENCE OMIPIPARTIALFROMPOLYBIUS OMIPIPARTIALFROMDIAGONALRACE OMIPIPARTIALFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOR OMIPILOWER OMIPIUPPER OMIPIPARTIALFROMINCIDENCEMATCHES OMIPIPARTIALFROMPOLYBIUSMATCHESINCIDENCE OMIPIPARTIALFROMDIAGONALRACEMATCHESPOLYBIUS OMIPIPARTIALFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATORMATCHESRACE OMIPIPROJECTIONSERIESCONVERGES OMIPIPROJECTIONINTERVALROUTE OMIPIPARTIALERRORBOUND OMIPIPARTIALERRORBOUNDEXPLICIT OMIPIEQUALSREALPI OMIPIINCIDENCEPROJECTIONSERIESCONVERGES OMIPIINCIDENCELIMIT OMIPIFROMINCIDENCE OMIPIFROMINCIDENCEEQUALSOMIPI OMIPIFROMINCIDENCEEQUALSPI OMIPIPOLYBIUSPROJECTIONSERIESCONVERGES OMIPIPOLYBIUSLIMIT OMIPIFROMPOLYBIUS OMIPIFROMPOLYBIUSEQUALSINCIDENCE OMIPIFROMPOLYBIUSEQUALSPI OMIPIDIAGONALRACEPROJECTIONSERIESCONVERGES OMIPIDIAGONALRACELIMIT OMIPIFROMDIAGONALRACE OMIPIFROMDIAGONALRACEEQUALSPOLYBIUS OMIPIFROMDIAGONALRACEEQUALSPI OMIPIDIAGONALACCUMULATORPROJECTIONSERIESCONVERGES OMIPIDIAGONALACCUMULATORLIMIT OMIPIFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOR OMIPIFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOREQUALSRACE OMIPIFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOREQUALSPI OMIPIBOUNDS DIAGONALACCSERIESEQTGALT DIAGONALACCSERIESCVFROMTGALT DIAGONALACCSERIESCV OMIPIFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATORA OMIPIFROMDIAGONALACCUMULATOREQUALSPIA CELLINCIDENCE CELL CELLINCIDENCEBALANCE CELLINCIDENCEA CELLA CELLINCIDENCEBALANCEA CELLINCIDENCEB CELLB CELLINCIDENCEBALANCEB CELLVERTEXFIGUREISICOSAHEDRON TRIAKISTETRAHEDRONINCIDENCE TRIAKISTETRAHEDRON TRIAKISTETRAHEDRONINCIDENCEA TRIAKISVERTEXDISTRIBUTION TRIAKISCENTERLINEBALANCE FIVECELLSELFDUALBALANCE DODECAICOSABALANCEPRESERVED CELLINCIDENCEC CELLC CELLINCIDENCEBALANCEC CELLDUALCELL CELLINCIDENCED CELLD CELLINCIDENCEBALANCED CELLINCIDENCEE CELLE CELLINCIDENCEBALANCEE CELLCELLDUAL SCOPEB SCOPEC NIBBLEAXIS NIBBLEA RELATIONWORD RELATIONLOCAL RELATIONREMOTE RELATIONSCOPE RELATIONOP RELATIONDECODEOK RELATIONBOARDOK RELATIONWORDBOUND RELATIONDECODEOKSMALL RELATIONBOARDEXHAUSTIVEOK OPERATIONWORD OPERATIONRELATION OPERATIONDIALECT SAMPLERELATION SAMPLEDIALECT SAMPLEOPERATION OPERATIONSAMPLEDECODES OPERATIONWORDBOUND OPERATIONSAMPLEDECODESOK WITNESSFROMRELATIONDIALECT WITNESSFROMRELATIONDIALECTWIDTH REPETEND REPETENDLENGTH REPETENDSUM DIGITSTATE DIGITSFROM DIGITS REM DERIVEDBASEFROM DIGITSISREPETEND REMRETURNSTOONE POWMOD ORDERCHECKS DECIMALPERIODISBYCHECK DERIVEDBASEFROMIS RELATIONENCODINGAUDIT RELATIONENCODINGAUDITHOLDS COUNTN INDEXCARRIER INDEXCARRIERCOUNT INDEXCARRIERUNIQUE PRODUCTLIST UNIQUEBY UNIQUEBYNODUP UNIQUEN UNIQUENNODUP DERIVEDTETRAVERTEX DERIVEDTETRAVERTICES DERIVEDTETRAVERTEXCODE DERIVEDTETRAVERTEXCOUNT DERIVEDTETRAFORCES DERIVEDTETRAVERTICESUNIQUE DERIVEDCELLVERTEX DERIVEDCELLVERTICES DERIVEDCELLVERTEXCODE DERIVEDCELLEDGES DERIVEDCELLEDGECODE DERIVEDCELLFACES DERIVEDCELLFACECODE DERIVEDCELLCELLS DERIVEDCELLCELLCODE DERIVEDCELLCOUNTS DERIVEDCELLCARRIERSUNIQUE BITVALUES BOOLCODE DERIVEDTESSERACTVERTICES BOOLCODEA DERIVEDTESSERACTVERTEXCOUNT DERIVEDTESSERACTFORCES DERIVEDTESSERACTVERTICESUNIQUE AXIS AXES AXISCODE DERIVEDSIG